<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 7.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/95     98/101     UNQ     200/202</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    102/105   190/195   205/210</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices eased on Friday with some majors lowering offers to sell off their stocks, traders said. Anticipations that prices could fall to match levels at other ports in this region, decreased enquiries, traders said. They said poor demand and ample supplies caused prices to fall.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870 3571)</p>
